  "text_md": "<!-- image -->\n\n## Take Action Be a Voice for Wild Buffalo!\n\n## Tell Gov Bullock to Leave a Wild Legacy\n\nCome volunteer and stand with wild buffalo!\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Get Involved &amp; Volunteer!\n\nContact BFC to learn about vol on the front lines, joining our summer outreach team, hosting video showings;   distributing letters, and other ways you can the to save the herds! Email info@buffalofieldcampaignorg or call (406) 646-0070. See all the details at buffalofieldcampaign orglvolunteerwith-us. spread word\n\nHecanorder the Montana executive   unteering branch to start a process   and leave a that this country can be of! Phone calls are best because cant be ignored, but you can back your call up with an email. Call Gov: Bullock at (406) 444-3111 and email governor@mt.gov.  Wild is the Roam Free! public proud they Way\n\n## Support BFC!\n\nIndividuals like   you contribute the majority of Buffalo Field Campaign's budget: All donations are tax deduct ible. Make a secure online contribution at BuffaloFieldCampaign.org oruse the enclosed envelope to donate by mail.\n\nVisit BuffaloFieldCampaign org for our complete Take Action page and to sign up for Updates from the Field.\n\n- facebook com/buffalowild\n- You Tube youtube com/bfcmedia\n- instagram.com /buffalofieldcampaign\n- twittercom/BFC\\_WildBison\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMontana Governor Steve Bullock has his sights set on the White House. Tell him you take the buffalo into the booth with Ask Gov. Bullock for a new decision with involvement and comment to protect more year-round habitat for wild buffalo, including the south side of the Madison River on the Custer Gallatin National Forest, where still takes place on cattle-free land. you! voting public hazing public",
